claims:
1. An apparatus configured for generating a multi-resource software development work graph structure, the apparatus comprising at least one processor, and at least one non-transitory memory including program code, the at least one non-transitory memory and the program code configured to, with the at least one processor, cause the apparatus to:
identify a plurality of resource objects, wherein each resource object is associated with resource data;
for each resource object:
extract one or more features based on the resource data associated with the resource object;
identify, based on the one or more features, a resource object relationship between the resource object and each other resource object of the plurality of resource objects; and
generate, based on each resource object relationship for each resource object, a multi-resource software development work graph structure interrelating the plurality of resource objects.

15. A computer program product for generating a multi-resource software development work graph structure, the computer program product comprising at least one non-transitory computer-readable storage medium having computer-readable program code portions stored therein, the computer-readable program code portions configured to:
for each resource object of a plurality of resource objects:
extract one or more features based on resource data associated with the resource object;
identify, based on the one or more features, a resource object relationship between the resource object and each other resource object of the plurality of resource objects; and
generate, based on each resource object relationship for each resource object, a multi-resource software development work graph structure interrelating the plurality of resource objects.
